      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The strike bypasses Profound Ice House and hits the outside world so precisely that the soul beasts cannot stop it. She destroys most of the hidden Gu worms this way and pulls one Immortal Gu out of the map; after that Immortal Gu is lost, fighting soul battlefield breaks down rapidly and the remaining Gu retreat on their own. The cast also shows her foundation: a wisdom path Gu Immortal skilled at investigation and long ranged attacks, more battle type than deduction type.",
      "chapters": [
        905
      ],
